            "envCode": "PRO",
            "templateKey": "confirm-task",
            "templateTitle": "确认任务",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>任务确认单</title>\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #e9ecef; padding: 30px; }\n        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 5px solid #3498db; }\n        h2 { color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }\n        th, td { padding: 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n        th { background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #666; font-weight: 600; }\n        .total-row td { font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; color: #e74c3c; border-bottom: none; }\n        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; text-align: center; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>任务确认单 #${taskId!\"00000\"}</h2>\n        <p>尊敬的 <strong>${assignee!\"负责人\"}</strong>，您有一个新任务需要确认，详情如下：</p>\n        \n        <table>\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                    <th>任务项</th>\n                    <th>状态</th>\n                    <th>预估耗时</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <#if tasks?? && (tasks?size > 0)>\n                    <#list tasks as task>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>${task.name}</td>\n                        <td>${task.status}</td>\n                        <td>${task.estimatedHours} 小时</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    </#list>\n                <#else>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center; color: #999;\">暂无子任务</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </#if>\n            </tbody>\n            <tfoot>\n                <tr class=\"total-row\">\n                    <td colspan=\"2\">总预估耗时</td>\n                    <td>${totalHours!\"0\"} 小时</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tfoot>\n        </table>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>系统自动生成于 ${generateTime!\"--\"} | 调试用模板</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
